给药间隔缩短）及给药错误（如误用安慰剂、注射部位错误、漏给后补给规则）的识别、报告、处理及随访流程。当前允许来源确认了给药方案为210mg每月一次皮下注射，但未提供项目级药物过量处理规程、给药错误分类与报告要求、紧急处理措施及后续安全性随访安排，无法撰写有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_bdf8ed3a973a4ac0","section_number":"6.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f2a28562244105a3b87f9ecd","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006012612_a5a450e8","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"SLN-611是皮下注射硬骨抑素（sclerostin）单抗，210mg每月一次皮下注射：210mg qm SC，共12个月。","quote_sha256":"b344e002289ab8f46494b1ea493baf32b240cfc67fe532daf4c2c1b464c65210","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_study_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","quote":"筛选、随机及每月给药访视至12个月；BMD于基线、6、12个月；骨转换标志物于基线、1、3、6、12个月。","quote_sha256":"733474da7f59731435f87c38a2b7042f7ccf5f2be816b3d72f270d0747694db8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","span_id":"es_study_visit"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_dosing","es_study_visit"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认依从性评价方法（注射记录、背景治疗用药日记或其他）、依从性核查频率、依从性不达标判定阈值及处理流程、背景治疗依从性是否纳入研究依从性评价范围。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_65_compliance_method","missing_source_classes":["项目级依从性评价操作规程","背景治疗依从性管理方案"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"},{"action":"确认漏给后是否允许补给、补给时间窗、连续漏给后是否触发永久停药评估。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_65_missed_dose","missing_source_classes":["项目级给药错误与漏给处理规程"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"}],"heading":"研究治疗依从性","missing_source_classes":["项目级依从性评价操作规程","背景治疗依从性管理方案"],"proposal_text":"本研究试验药物SLN-611（210mg）及匹配安慰剂均以皮下注射方式在研究中心内由经培训的医护人员执行，给药频率为每月一次，双盲治疗期共12个月。由于研究药物为研究中心内注射给药，受试者无需自行注射，研究药物的给药依从性由研究中心在每次给药访视时记录注射执行情况，包括实际注射日期、注射部位及注射是否完成。全部受试者同时接受钙剂联合维生素D背景治疗，该背景治疗的依从性管理方式及核查方法将在方案中另行规定。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：SLN-611为210mg每月一次皮下注射、匹配安慰剂每月一次皮下注射、12个月双盲治疗期、全部受试者补钙加维生素D背景治疗、访视策略含每月给药访视。未确认事项：依从性评价的具体方法（如注射部位轮换记录、背景治疗用药日记）、依从性不达标的判定阈值与处理流程、背景治疗依从性核查频率与方式、漏给后是否补给及补给时间窗。上述未确认事项需医学经理结合项目实际确定后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_0a8305e94f60ac3f","section_number":"6.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f2a28562244105a3b87f9ecd","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"80e2dc9b85e22cabd79bf61fca362f7206058fdade678101c1648e62f0f4065a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d5ebc58f4bba_e54ab29f43100c76:full-draft:f2a28562244105a3b87f9ecd","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f2a28562244105a3b87f9ecd","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d4bcfda355db92494e1792b8a712f5912f5c5f0842d8a34c2adf2dcffe0add9e:f2a28562244105a3b87f9ecd","text_sha256":"80e2dc9b85e22cabd79bf61fca362f7206058fdade678101c1648e62f0f4065a"},{"content_sha256":"01acde550034c139002b127618cadca82a0894fdead88903d47425241f006b8c","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:revision:5","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_e39e763face5655bdf2f:r5:c11fc9a99a007d54","text_sha256":"01acde550034c139002b127618cadca82a0894fdead88903d47425241f006b8c"}]}